      ],
      "source": "https://www.claremontca.gov/Government/About/History"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1888, a local land company transferred Hotel Claremont and 260 lots to Pomona College, saving the town from becoming a ghost town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
